{"sections":[],"kind":"symbol","identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/AsyncSequences\/Materialize\/batch(strategy:)","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["Linux"],"tokens":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"batch","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Strategy","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":">(","kind":"text"},{"text":"strategy","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Strategy","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"AsyncSequences","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/AsyncSequences","preciseIdentifier":"s:7Afluent14AsyncSequencesO"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Batch","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/AsyncSequences\/Batch","preciseIdentifier":"s:7Afluent14AsyncSequencesO5BatchV"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Strategy","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"where","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Strategy","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"text":"BatchStrategy","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/BatchStrategy","preciseIdentifier":"s:7Afluent13BatchStrategyP"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Element","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sci7ElementQa"},{"text":" == ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Strategy","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Element","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/BatchStrategy\/Element","preciseIdentifier":"s:7Afluent13BatchStrategyP7ElementQa"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"parameters":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When to emit the gathered elements; its "},{"code":"Element","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is this"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"sequence’s, inferred from the call."}]}],"name":"strategy"}],"kind":"parameters"},{"content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Return Value","anchor":"return-value","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A sequence of the upstream’s elements, in order, in arrays of one or more."}]}],"kind":"content"},{"content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"discussion","type":"heading","text":"Discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The strategy decides when the pending elements are flushed: every so many elements"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"("},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/BatchStrategy\/count(_:)"},{"type":"text","text":"), every interval"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"("},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/BatchStrategy\/time(interval:clock:tolerance:)"},{"type":"text","text":"), on a signal or a unit of work"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"("},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/SignalBatchStrategy"},{"type":"text","text":"), whenever any of several does"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"("},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/BatchStrategy\/either(_:_:)"},{"type":"text","text":"), or by a rule of your own ("},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/BatchStrategy"},{"type":"text","text":"). After every"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"flush, each strategy starts over. A flush with nothing pending emits nothing; the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"sequence never emits an empty array."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"When the upstream finishes, the pending elements, if any, are emitted as a last array and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the sequence finishes. When the upstream throws, the pending elements are dropped and the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"sequence throws the same error. A signal that finishes stops firing while the batches go","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"on; a signal that throws ends the sequence with its error.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The upstream and the strategy run in tasks of their own, started when iteration begins,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"so the upstream is read ahead of the consumer, and arrays the consumer hasn’t taken yet"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"are buffered. Cancelling the consumer, or dropping its iterator, cancels both. An"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"upstream or signal that ignores cancellation keeps the internal task alive until its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"pending "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"next()"},{"type":"text","text":" returns, and is not read again after that; the batched sequence itself"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"ends at once."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Batching needs iOS 16, Mac Catalyst 16, macOS 13, tvOS 16, watchOS 9 or visionOS 1."}]},{"level":2,"anchor":"Example","type":"heading","text":"Example"},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["for try await batch in [1, 2, 3, 4].async.batch(strategy: .either(.count(3), .time(interval: .seconds(1), clock: ContinuousClock()))) {","    print(batch) \/\/ Prints [1, 2, 3], then [4]","}"]},{"name":"Throws","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Any error the upstream or the strategy throws."}]}],"type":"aside","style":"note"}],"kind":"content"}],"metadata":{"role":"symbol","platforms":[{"unavailable":false,"deprecated":false,"introducedAt":"16.0","name":"iOS","beta":false},{"unavailable":false,"deprecated":false,"introducedAt":"16.0","name":"iPadOS","beta":false},{"unavailable":false,"deprecated":false,"introducedAt":"16.0","name":"Mac Catalyst","beta":false},{"unavailable":false,"deprecated":false,"introducedAt":"13.0","name":"macOS","beta":false},{"unavailable":false,"deprecated":false,"introducedAt":"16.0","name":"tvOS","beta":false},{"unavailable":false,"deprecated":false,"introducedAt":"1.0","name":"visionOS","beta":false},{"unavailable":false,"deprecated":false,"introducedAt":"9.0","name":"watchOS","beta":false}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"batch"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"Strategy"},{"kind":"text","text":">("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"strategy"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Strategy"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"AsyncSequences","preciseIdentifier":"s:7Afluent14AsyncSequencesO"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Batch","preciseIdentifier":"s:7Afluent14AsyncSequencesO5BatchV"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Self"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Strategy"},{"kind":"text","text":">"}],"remoteSource":{"fileName":"BatchSequence.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Afluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Afluent\/SequenceOperators\/BatchSequence.swift#L221"},"symbolKind":"method","title":"batch(strategy:)","roleHeading":"Instance Method","externalID":"s:Sci7Afluents8SendableRzsAB7ElementRpzrlE5batch8strategyAA14AsyncSequencesO5BatchVy_xqd__Gqd___tAA0H8StrategyRd__ACQyd__ADRSlF::SYNTHESIZED::s:7Afluent14AsyncSequencesO11MaterializeV","modules":[{"name":"Afluent","relatedModule